    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_2622",
      "reading_order": 3535,
      "severity": "caution",
      "content": "CAUTION: Some parts are sensitive to electrostatic discharge (ESD). Always perform service",
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 341.53499,
        "r": 181.75,
        "b": 329.94499
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0883",
      "reading_order": 3537,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 191.18421450550161,
        "t": 345.4765625,
        "r": 210.30236600256768,
        "b": 324.4554138183594
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0883.png",
      "decorative": true,
      "width": 19,
      "height": 21,
      "image_hash": "8412fec8e923960f0a1074c8f1c203b51765f9b44e344f508f08a2c28a4b03b6",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_2623",
      "next_block_id": "txt_2624"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2624",
      "reading_order": 3538,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 322.92,
        "r": 549.7700400000001,
        "b": 287.33
      },
      "content": "work at an ESD-protected workstation or mat. If an ESD workstation or mat is not available, touch the sheet-metal chassis to provide a static ground before touching an ESD-sensitive assembly. Protect the ESD-sensitive assemblies by placing them in ESD pouches when they are out of the printer."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2625",
      "reading_order": 3539,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00004,
        "t": 277.9200000000001,
        "r": 548.6300400000002,
        "b": 242.32999999999993
      },
      "content": "If the replacement part is a roller or pad, avoid touching the spongy part of it. Skin oils on the roller or pad can cause paper pickup and/or print-quality problems. HP recommends using disposable gloves when handling rollers or pads or washing your hands before touching rollers or pads."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_2626",
      "reading_order": 3540,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 232.91999999999996,
        "r": 541.73,
        "b": 221.32999999999993
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Make sure that all of the shipping materials (for example shipping tape) are removed"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_2627",
      "reading_order": 3541,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00003,
        "t": 220.91999999999996,
        "r": 330.11003,
        "b": 209.32999999999993
      },
      "content": "from the replacement part prior to installation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_2628",
      "reading_order": 3542,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 198.41999999999996,
        "r": 343.02,
        "b": 186.83000000000004
      },
      "content": "To install an assembly, reverse the removal steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2629",
      "reading_order": 3543,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00002,
        "t": 177.41999999999996,
        "r": 551.6100400000003,
        "b": 141.83000000000004
      },
      "content": "When applicable, special installation instructions are provided for an assembly at the end of the removal procedure. Always completely read the removal instructions and follow all special installation instructions."
    },
